OL,3,GNEWSARevolut customers scammed out of
OL,4,A#180k, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are warning people using to be
OL,7,Fvigilant following a significant
OL,8,Fincrease in fraud and scam reports
OL,9,Finvolving financial technology and
OL,10,Fapps.
OL,12,FThe States of Jersey Police said 75% of
OL,13,Fall scam crimes reported on the island
OL,14,Fover four weeks had involved Revolut
OL,15,Faccounts, with victims collectively
OL,16,Flosing about #180,000.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for Revolut said it took
OL,19,Ffraud and the risk of its customers
OL,20,Fbeing targeted by impersonation scams
OL,21,F"extremely seriously".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
