OL,3,GNEWSARevolut customers scammed out of
OL,4,A#180k, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We urge customers to remain vigilant
OL,7,Fwhen receiving unexpected calls and
OL,8,Fremind them that Revolut will never ask
OL,9,Fthem to share passwords, passcodes or
OL,10,Fsecurity information or transfer money
OL,11,Fto a 'safe account'," the spokesperson
OL,12,Fsaid.
